<title>JAPAN: Israel launches 3.0% 10-yr samurai--Daiwa Sec.</title>
<headline>Israel launches 3.0% 10-yr samurai--Daiwa Sec.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following samurai issue was announced by lead-manager Daiwa Securities on Wednesday:</p>
<p> BORROWER	  Israel</p>
<p> AMT		 20 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON	    3.0 pct</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 99.85</p>
<p> MATURITY	  3 Aug 2007</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  4 Aug 1997</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	July 28 to July 31</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     S&amp;P A-, Moody's A3</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Daiwa Securities</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    Fuji Bank</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8785</p>
</text>
